%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 550ea12f8a449cb44a14b91aff3965d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sari-Sari Store Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueText
  dialogueBox:
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: 'Magandang umaga!


      <i>Hi, good day!'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Sa iyo rin. Anong gusto mong bilhin?


      <i>Hello, what would
      you want to buy?'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: "Ano pong pwede kong bilhin sa \u20B120?\n\n<i>May I know what I can
      buy for \u20B120?"
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: "Hmmm, Parang wala masyadong mabibili sa \u20B120. instant noodles
      kaya?\n\n<i>Hmmm. I don\u2019t think you can buy a lot with \u20B120. How about
      instant noodles?"
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: 'Sige, eh kanin kaya?


      <i>Ok but how about rice?'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: "\u20B160 bawat kilo \u2018yan.\n\n<i>That\u2019s \u20B160 per kilo."
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: 'Sige. Pero paano mabubuhay ang mga tao nang ganito?


      <i>Ok.
      But how can someone survive like this?'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Maraming bagay ang nagdala sa atin sa sitwasyong ito. Ang bigas ay
      naging isang mahalagang tindang hindi na maabot ng marami.


      <i>Many
      things have brought us to this situation. Rice has become an expensive commodity,
      becoming unattainable for many.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Ang pagbabago ng klima ay nakadagdag pa sa pagbaba ng ani ng mga pananim.
      Ngayon, umaangkat na tayo ng bigas mula sa mga ibang bansa. Dahil sa nagbabagong
      mundo, nangailangang baguhin natin ang ating mga nakagawian sa pagkain.


      <i>Climate
      change compounds this by making crops yield less. We now import rice from other
      countries. Because of this changed world, we have adapted our eating habits.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: 'Ano ang alternatibo?


      <i>What is the alternative?'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Sa puntong ito, bumili ka na lang ng mga nakahandang pagkain mula
      sa mga korporasyon.


      <i>At this point, you just buy ready-made food
      from corporations.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Ang malawakang pagmamanupaktura ay nagbigay ng pagkaing abot-kaya
      nga ngunit hindi naman masustansya. Ang sistemang kapitalista ay gumagana upang
      magbigay ng pakinabang sa mga nasa kapangyarihan habang ang iba ay nagtatrabaho
      lamang upang mabuhay.


      <i>Mass manufacturing has made food both affordable
      and unhealthy. The capitalist system works to provide gains to those in power
      while the rest merely survive.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: "Nakakalungkot naman \u2018yan. Nabubuhay lang ang mga magulang ko
      sa minimum wage na kinikita nila. Bakit naging ganito ang mundo?\n\n<i>That
      is sad. My parents live day-to-day with their minimum wage. How did the world
      become like this?"
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Ang punto ng pagbabago ay nagtutulak sa atin upang makita kung ano
      ang mali sa paraan ng ating pamumuhay. Marahil ay naghihintay lamang tayo na
      bumagsak ang buong sistema, na gumuho ang mundo.


      <i>The tipping point
      moves us to see what is wrong in the way we live. Perhaps we are just waiting
      for the entire system to collapse, for the world to collapse.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Kapag nangyari iyon, saka lamang tayo kikilos tulad sa pagkatapos
      ng isang bagyo na nagpapaunawa sa atin sa lakas ng kalikasan. Kumikilos lamang
      tayo kapag nakikita na natin ang lawak ng bisa nito.


      <i>When that happens,
      we then take action as in the case of the aftermath of a typhoon which makes
      us understand the power of nature. We only take action when we see the scale
      of its effect.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: "Sige, sa tingin ko pwede na itong instant noodles, gutom na talaga
      ako, kahit ano ay kakainin ko na.\n\n<i>Ok I guess, I\u2019ll take that instant
      noodles, I\u2019m very hungry, I\u2019ll take anything at this point."
  - isNPCSpeaking: 1
    speaker: Vendor
    dialogue: 'Ito po.


      <i>Here you go.'
  - isNPCSpeaking: 0
    speaker: Girl
    dialogue: 'Maraming salamat.


      <i>Thank you.'
  responses: []
